      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A superb 4-bedroom detached family residence located in the highly sought-after Harbour Grove development on the Point Road. This spacious and beautifully presented home offers modern living in a peaceful coastal setting, just minutes from Dundalk town centre, the M1 motorway, schools, shops, and the scenic Navvy Bank walkway. Harbour Grove is renowned for its attractive detached homes and tranquil surroundings close to the estuary and coastline.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious living room, a contemporary kitchen/dining area ideal for family life and entertaining, a second sitting room, utility room, guest WC, and four generously sized bedrooms, two of which are en-suite bedrooms, providing excellent comfort and privacy for family members or guests, together with a modern family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property enjoys off-street parking and a private rear garden, perfect for outdoor dining, relaxation, and family activities. The detached design offers additional space, privacy, and excellent natural light throughout.\r\n\r\nThis impressive home combines modern convenience with an exceptional location, making it an ideal choice for growing families seeking a quality residence in one of Dundalk's most desirable residential areas. Viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
